{"id":"6b23223b4dd97161","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy.md","title":"有效分层标准结构上的真理域与本层不可定义性","display":"prop-truth-definition-hierarchy — 有效分层标准结构上的真理域与本层不可定义性","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy","aliases":["91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy","91-prop-definition-hierarchy","91-prop-truth-definition-levels"],"display":"prop-truth-definition-hierarchy — 有效分层标准结构上的真理域与本层不可定义性","depends_on":["[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","[[91-df-ramified-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy</span><span>91-prop-definition-hierarchy</span><span>91-prop-truth-definition-levels</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-definition-hierarchy — 有效分层标准结构上的真理域与本层不可定义性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"706acac2c3076a7b\" href=\"?note=706acac2c3076a7b\" title=\"91-df-ramified-truth\">91-df-ramified-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是一给定有效可编码良序指标集，每个初始语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span> 的句法可算术编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha\">\\(T_\\alpha\\)</span> 不在该语言中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span> 的算术约化为标准 ℕ，较低 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\beta\">\\(T_\\beta\\)</span> 解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\beta})\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\beta})\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta&lt;\\alpha\">\\(\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\)</span>），按 I 递归给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha\">\\(\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha\\)</span> 是 T_α 对该初始语言句子的双条件集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> 见上游定理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definition\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}}\\;\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha}}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definition\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{&lt;\\alpha}}\\;\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha}}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha}[T_\\alpha\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha})]\\models\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha}[T_\\alpha\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{&lt;\\alpha})]\\models\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只在已声明有效句法和标准结构的层上应用 Tarski；不是任意不可编码序数语言都可无条件对角化。第二式通过元层外延定义扩张，不代表同一初始语言已显式定义自己的全真理。\n原书 RT 有编码化的组合公理、累积条件及完整归纳，不能用这个元层逐句语义描述取代它的整套公理。这里修复的是层级真句集合的语义环境。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 9.1–9.2；Tarski 对角论证的有效层推广。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ramified-truth","status":"resolved","id":"706acac2c3076a7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ramified-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{<\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{<\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{<\\beta})","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta<\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definition\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_{<\\alpha}}\\;\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_{<\\alpha}}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{<\\alpha})).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{<\\alpha}[T_\\alpha\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_{<\\alpha})]\\models\\operatorname{TB}_\\alpha.","display":true}],"bytes":1939,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-definition-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["c289f1c721012496","706acac2c3076a7b"]}